{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6e55d60e3fdd6f0feec76e91fc6b6cc89347f64edac6624ddc279fb67d8935e2", "ja": "いっしょに歌おう", "zh": "一起唱吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6412b6f905b1ac2410fb2c02f81e723b188bf92a01c9907d588861f15d77ad21", "ja": "入院中の女の子のため、病院のクリスマス会\nに飛び入り参加することになったメンバー。\nその練習中、ソプラノパートの男の子が飛び\n出してしまうが、瑞希とエレナの励ましで、\n男の子は元気を取り戻す。", "zh": "为了住院的女孩子们，成员们决定临时参加医院的圣诞会。\n练习期间，负责女高音声部的男孩子跑了出去，但在瑞希和艾蕾娜的鼓励下，男孩子重新振作起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "370ff7b85f1bc6c2d9e21dc129029446467610a6473ddf3a7050a0947913efa4", "ja": "（真から、入院している合唱団の女の子を\n励ますために、病院を訪ねたいと相談を受けた）", "zh": "（真来找我商量，说想去医院，鼓励那位住院的合唱团女孩）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d24137755ed670515a963ea6700920c1bb827a5919cdd8acfad801b100ffcc6c", "ja": "（病院と交渉した結果、真達は病院のクリスマス会に\n参加させてもらう事になった。今日は、リハーサルだ）", "zh": "（和医院协商之后，真她们得以参加医院的圣诞会。今天要进行彩排。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "1467787bacce916116e6152a3bcd181af0c63170f5c403c32063431e587827b6", "ja": "今日は私が、伴奏を務めます。ピアノは久しぶりで、\n緊張しますが……よろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "今天由我来伴奏。好久没弹钢琴了，虽然有些紧张……还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "f46b22d55978f1ea5341db2f546fe83a7629287faf7ef7115ae6ec1852187b39", "ja": "それじゃ、瑞希お姉さんの伴奏に合わせて\nみんなで歌ってみようね！", "zh": "那么，大家就跟着瑞希姐姐的伴奏一起唱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "8cf077efa96feb634f3f7257ac0eab9113a980b0fc260ab1f436ceaf07d2c73d", "ja": "間違えても、かまいませんわ。\n楽しく歌いましょう！", "zh": "就算唱错了也没关系。让我们开心地唱歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1005_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "6f379a3e55b30a401e2ffc8522b5ffc15879a3eed25086973aea7415362e447f", "ja": "みんな、いいお返事だネ！\nそれじゃあいくヨ～！　さんはいっ♪", "zh": "大家的回应都很棒呢！\n那就开始吧～！预备——起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "23c4c79b2682770516edea3402da0e3478e1856b23b8fab1fe0bb87bf1096a10", "ja": "……？　あの子……。", "zh": "……？那个孩子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "58e0e8cc785bd182ac0eeea3b4159985efb6d4bee5bfe3f46b37370be2750d83", "ja": "わぁ……みんな、すっごく上手だよ！\nこの調子で、もう一回合わせてみようか。", "zh": "哇……大家，都做得超级棒哦！\n照这个状态，我们再合练一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1011_insotsusensei", "source_sha256": "fb9b22c8db4b3d50322406b1023a695f8cacae23b49de8908ef155f07553c4a0", "ja": "次は、ちゃんと歌うのよ？\nみんなだって、頑張ってるでしょ？", "zh": "下次要好好唱哦？\n大家也都在努力，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1012_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "b2f2eddfc901852cd6c6072cdc3b50cdde6b734f13b34f588b87e0dcf7ef81df", "ja": "……だって……。", "zh": "……可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "c4c13dfefe2e83eea33743fa78900ebc7b6cd90bc70b1a9263619579475745e6", "ja": "あら……どうかなさいまして？", "zh": "哎呀……您这是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1014_insotsusensei", "source_sha256": "da6ffc7ef89ef5d37c2b3e54146dcbb0c05b751121446e9e652b2140dc5ab363", "ja": "あっ、すみません。\nこの子が、歌えなかったものですから……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n因为这孩子没能唱出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "b064f3935b1557cacccce98b1cefd926d63b047f7523428213589619a37b7dd1", "ja": "緊張してしまったのかしら……。\n心配いりませんわ、ぼく。", "zh": "是因为紧张了吗……\n不用担心，小朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "eddf09ff1485d49f7e8d248e95eec1b449edcc519162e594f917538ce79d623e", "ja": "これはリハーサル、練習ですもの。\n安心して、大きな声で歌ってくださいましね？", "zh": "这是彩排，也就是练习嘛。\n请放心，大声唱出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1017_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "68faa577595cda6aaecf2593abf013081507298400223145f1b033153d58ad6e", "ja": "あっ、ぼく！？", "zh": "啊，我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "34c597014525664014d5756c8a5f75bc3c4436a8e42b9be6689b72271732ee1d", "ja": "待って！　……行っちゃった。", "zh": "等等！……走掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1020_insotsusensei", "source_sha256": "7a59acc62cc97c5eb4b8b408034048c1fe7dcb2c168ca1153f7b759a2271d17c", "ja": "す、すみません！　待って、ヨウくん！", "zh": "对、对不起！等等，ヨウ！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1021_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "f299849515bcb94eb0b3822a8c320efe3d5357d848d3f5577218a27336842978", "ja": "どうしましょう……。わたくし、何か\nいけないことを言ってしまったのかしら……。", "zh": "该怎么办才好……难道是我说了什么不该说的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c7ea945b27bc81cc1daa0893a45e08fffd1116fb1982862ef7e17d547fd2c09e", "ja": "そんな事はないと思いますが……俺が探してきます。\nみんなは、ここで待っててくれ。", "zh": "我觉得不是那样……我去找找看。\n大家就在这里等着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "73e68ce0ea5e13312148819d14f05eff198d21df744dcf06c5a3d64afabf5474", "ja": "{$P$}。私も、行きます。\n……なんとなくですが、心当たりがあるので。", "zh": "{$P$}。我也去。\n……虽然只是隐约有点头绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a8554b17025632b790fcf59a456c7b57c0ba1da7461ac8317444a422f7eeb03f", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか？\nなら瑞希、悪いけど手伝ってくれ。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？\n那瑞希，不好意思，帮我一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "38419008b73efa0a73499a05318a11b7c310021bb6e2bdfc7421bd74eddbc7d1", "ja": "ミズキ、ワタシも行くヨ！", "zh": "水树，我也要去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "e98ceab327ae659298a7ed1637780c7ed94bff09daf147b9158292a0b7365d4a", "ja": "島原さん、ありがとうございます。……では、\n{$P$}は、劇場内をお願いします。", "zh": "岛原小姐，谢谢你。……那么，\n{$P$}就拜托负责剧场内部了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b7b7af90b591b845ed9879c31262c01a4f8243a0e2b2c897658dbf82049148d4", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\n真、千鶴さん。みんなのこと……。", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n真、千鹤。大家就拜托你们了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "5d7e70d2882deefd8d415f0ba5dac39cbd687d3d07de7b71148a6e12fdb8a5df", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}！\nここはボクたちに任せてください！", "zh": "没问题的，{$P$}！\n这里就交给我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "4f7532b4e57a300adc0f51b5a4d4c48f39bfbeff98850855bbd4b8a6a70b6a52", "ja": "さあみんなー、ちょっと休憩しよう！\nボクたちと遊ばない？", "zh": "来吧，大家——稍微休息一下吧！\n要不要和我们一起玩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ab414f674cb5e62df72f94fbfec831cedfa307062e9f6c21245473e1e0b6d2c", "ja": "あら、いいですわね！\nそれでは、だるまさんがころんだをしましょうか。", "zh": "哎呀，这主意不错呢！\n那么，我们来玩“一二三木头人”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "db48e3f80068c6323d4473a12be5cb3fce1ccd7fc022dedfb1936ae14383e375", "ja": "あっ！　いたよ、ミズキ！\nねえ、待って～！", "zh": "啊！找到了，瑞希！\n等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "41e4df38352ad17045aed639ff2acecb36f8663a7331b64e1d2e051e5f8a2c74", "ja": "……おっと。捕まえましたよ。", "zh": "……哎呀。抓住你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "1b98ad14c2ef341e0490710eff08406eb1549b5f55e7c3592faa7c956b6dc87c", "ja": "よかったら、私たちと少しお話しませんか？\n……大丈夫。ここには、私と島原さんしかいません。", "zh": "如果不介意的话，能和我们聊一聊吗？\n……没事的。这里只有我和岛原同学。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "fe3877962e920b87b028db718b0a9732d3be0e59bf156936f8001cb2f65051dd", "ja": "どうして、急に出ていっちゃったノ？\n合唱、イヤだったのかナ？", "zh": "为什么突然离开了呢？\n不喜欢合唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1039_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "6a31c192d297b8337ca307f7a2cead302b48897e5081bec42a4ee961c52681cb", "ja": "……そうじゃ、ないけど……。", "zh": "……也不是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "9a65d184267c7afdf73697a29a3857aedfa550ae75530ebfd1150e6bcb04926a", "ja": "ソプラノパートが、嫌でしたか？", "zh": "你是不喜欢女高音部分吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1041_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "6247137b8bd07bb32a10bc893af3fe872563a8520b4ff5f67d6a91c1f9956a8d", "ja": "っ！　……なんでわかったの？", "zh": "！……你怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "836eb9cf5141594618c5797344f904a416319224f017ffcaa9f914dfd23e2e98", "ja": "はい。私は、今日は伴奏をすることになったので、\nみんなの様子を見ていました。", "zh": "是的。因为我今天负责伴奏，所以一直在观察大家的状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "2414c5ec7172fc40570cbcc770b0740ddb0984766e7451f0d93d232f73554cd0", "ja": "あなたはずっと、他のパートのお友達を\n見ていたようでしたので。", "zh": "因为你一直在看其他声部的朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1044_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "b84e1778d6515fd91475868a588869bc3a7e5a4ff757582808aeabd6d5abf4b7", "ja": "……だって……男なのに、ソプラノなんてさ……。", "zh": "……因为……明明是男生，却唱女高音什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "37de1fd1c94694b9c5b8d0058903c404853724578c1028f7acea26d919b792e4", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。でもワタシ、\nキミの声、とってもキレイだなって思うヨ？", "zh": "原来是这样啊……不过，我觉得你的声音真的特别好听哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1046_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "54f2c8b27eeb00b345f32ee097236104ad8935299cf81399be40cd792e9f4d7a", "ja": "ちっともキレイじゃないよ。こんな声……。", "zh": "一点也不动听。这样的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "babf79dc082393ec9eb507d5e217796c9a6a71c8aa2975dfa2c95bce35a35601", "ja": "いいえ、とても素敵ですよ。\n聞いていると、優しい気持ちになれます。", "zh": "不，非常动听哦。\n听着听着，整个人都会变得温柔起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "3482be7f3d14fb2bda1eeb37dfd2b4b86c5bb11f061df70aaea1c4a3ad2825e9", "ja": "そうそう！　恥ずかしくなんてないヨ。\nそのキレイな声は、キミの個性なんだもん！", "zh": "对对！一点都不用害羞哦。\n那动听的歌声就是你的个性嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1049_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "508b1c84e7875966e50f51760cc66b3426ae1be9279482b30a22cc4d2dfd56a8", "ja": "個性……？", "zh": "个性……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "8518d4c6af1cf4c34b9fa62ed9a9cec380b70293e1acc9234f6e14c37bd25d2d", "ja": "そっ。ワタシたちの{$P$}が\n言ってたよ？　みんな違うほうが、楽しいんだって！", "zh": "对呀。我们的{$P$}说过哦？大家各不相同，才更有趣嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1051_044miz", "source_sha256": "3f17cc0fa5462150d18f6f3a707a298f5ac771e5a601ec2f477909998266e372", "ja": "私は、あなたと一緒に歌いたいです。\nあなたがいなくなったら、とても寂しくなります。", "zh": "我想和你一起唱歌。\n如果你不在了，我会非常寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1052_018ele", "source_sha256": "727b07216081ac4642a2a4bde29cab0819b84f23c76022bfc789c0ae4445494c", "ja": "ワタシも、キミがいてくれないと悲しいナ。\nせっかく仲良しになれたのに……。", "zh": "我也会因为没有你在身边而难过呢。\n好不容易才成为了好朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1053_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "61c73db503dbdd22c1092389eb0603510118e8ed4267a5dca0ec73998cb14639", "ja": "……あ……。", "zh": "……啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1054_018ele", "source_sha256": "95bd214487cf8ef2cdb5d1af008d21f2c48e7987139d27996b718de7cbf405b5", "ja": "だから、ワタシたちと一緒に歌おうヨ！\n今度こそ、キミの歌声が聴きたいナ♪", "zh": "所以，和我们一起唱吧！\n这次，我真的想听到你的歌声呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1055_044miz", "source_sha256": "618107cf3b07ca8ea68e26734ed8efb46b86405ab83601250f5dffc89879799b", "ja": "私からも、お願いします。\n一緒に、歌ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "我也想请求您。\n能和我们一起唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1056_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "b70056d33664adf30b068ae48f8eb82e9dd63195db35ba9e60b560d2d5636fe5", "ja": "……うん……わかった。\nもう一回、がんばってみる……。", "zh": "……嗯……我知道了。\n我会再努力试一次的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0214_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_05_1057_044miz", "source_sha256": "b045cf09d736a77f53ecc2f291305255a845c99fd0a372299702b5196a8f57b8", "ja": "ふふ。よかったです。\n……それでは、戻って練習再開、だぞ。", "zh": "呵呵。太好了。\n……那么，回去继续练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
